# The agent router. It is mostly WIDE TABLES, and Prettier re-pads every row
# in one whenever a single cell changes width — so a one-row edit arrives as
# a diff over the whole table and the actual change is invisible in review.
# Its symlinked aliases (CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md, .cursorrules, .windsurfrules,
# .github/copilot-instructions.md) are the same file and are named too, since
# Prettier resolves a symlink before matching this list.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# The agent skills and the lesson fragments beside them (`.claude/skills` and
# `.gemini/skills` are symlinks onto the same tree). Same wide tables as
# AGENTS.md, with a sharper edge: every skill is edited by whatever session
# happens to be doing that subject's work, so a re-pad of one column turns two
# parallel sessions' one-row edits into a conflict over the whole block. Their
# tables are written in the compact `| a | b |` form and stay that way.
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/
.gemini/skills/
